&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Machines will make decisions, move value, and coordinate on behalf of organizations, instantly, autonomously, and at unprecedented scale. But the systems that govern today’s economy weren’t designed for that world. Turnkey is building the infrastructure for this future: programmable guardrails that enable autonomy without sacrificing control.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded by the team that scaled Coinbase Custody to $100M+ in ARR and secured more than $100B in crypto assets, we’ve built the systems trusted to move and protect billions in value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to help the world operate an economy on autopilot, safely.We&#39;re low-ego, high-agency, and deeply technical. Our team consists of experts in cryptography, security, and systems who believe great infrastructure is invisible. We&#39;re building the trustless, programmable foundation for the autonomous economy, and we&#39;re hiring people who understand what that requires.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and refine targeted outbound strategies into high value verticals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research prospects deeply and craft messages that speak to their roadmap, pain points, and potential crypto strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Events: regular participation in local (and international) industry events, meetups, and conferences as a core part of pipeline generation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and manage early stage pipelines in Attio and support weekly pipeline reviews with the revenue team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outbound-driven role: proactively sourcing and prospecting into target accounts rather than working an inbound queue. You&#39;ll run first-touch discovery on self-generated pipeline, qualify prospects against our ICP, and hand off high-quality, well-prepped opportunities to AEs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product, GTM team , and marketing to shape messaging, personas, and outbound campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring structured feedback from customers and the market to GTM leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Constantly experiment, iterate, and help build the playbook for outbound at Turnkey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Go above and beyond to fuel our GTM engine.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1 to 3 years in BDR, SDR, or similar outbound roles (startup or fintech/crypto experience is a plus, but not required).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written communication: crisp, thoughtful outreach that feels personalized and strategic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High curiosity for crypto, payments, fintech, or developer products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to simplify complex technical concepts and tell a clear story.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive, motivated resilient, and hungry to build something new&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working directly with founders, senior leaders, and enterprise stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bias for action: you move fast, ask smart questions, and figure things out.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with a world class founding team with deep domain expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct line to leadership: your work directly shapes our pipeline and revenue engine.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Massive market: Turnkey sits at the intersection of fintech, payments, AI, and global commerce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real ownership and upward mobility: early BDRs have the opportunity to touch many parts of the business and through high performance, can grow into AEs, partnerships, or strategic roles as the team scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly collaborative, fast moving environment built for people who want to win.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full benefits, including medical, dental, vision, life, disability, HSA/FSA, 401(k)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited PTO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;$3,000/yr learning and development budget for conferences and education&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multiple team offsites per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Compensation range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$75,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$110,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
